OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 24 JAN
OL,4,G0030FEras: Phil Collins
OL,5,     GReeling from the breakdown of his
OL,6,     Gmarriage, Phil Collins begins
OL,7,     Gwork on his first solo album -
OL,8,     Gfeaturing a drum fill that will
OL,9,     Gecho through pop music history.
OL,10,G0100FEras: Phil Collins
OL,11,     GAt the midpoint of the 1980s,
OL,12,     GPhil Collins reigns supreme. Live
OL,13,     GAid! Miami Vice! The red hot hit
OL,14,     Gstreak to end all hit streaks!
OL,15,     GWelcome to Phil's imperial era.
OL,16,G0130FEras: Phil Collins
OL,17,     GBruised by the tabloids, Phil
OL,18,     GCollins begins his gradual
OL,19,     Gretreat from show business. But
OL,20,     Gretirement is easier said than
OL,21,     Gdone for the hardest-working man
OL,22,     Gin pop.
